  "canonical_decisions_required": [
    "Strict RFC JSON rejects legacy-accepted comments, single quotes, unquoted keys, trailing commas, hex/octal/leading-zero integers and non-RFC outer whitespace.",
    "Unicode scalar validation rejects lone surrogate escapes that legacy Newtonsoft replaces with U+FFFD.",
    "Keep UTF-16 code-unit bounds explicit; counting Unicode scalars or UTF-8 bytes changes limits.",
    "Preserve .NET whitespace behavior deliberately; BOM and zero-width-space are not IsNullOrWhiteSpace.",
    "Missing/null/extra outer argument policy must be validated through the real SDK binder in native acceptance."
  ],
